      "title": "Windows: Make sure our extcap interface name includes its display name",
      "message": "Windows: Make sure our extcap interface name includes its display name\n\nIn get_iface_display_name, if our interface is an extcap, always return\nthe extcap name and device name. If an extcap provides multiple interfaces\nthis lets us distinguish between them and ensures that extcap interfaces\nare shown consistently across platforms.\n\nStrip \".exe\" from a couple of extcap device names.\n",
      "author_name": "Gerald Combs",
      "author_email": "gerald@wireshark.org",
      "authored_date": "2024-11-06T17:52:15.000+01:00",
      "committer_name": "AndersBroman",
